{"id": "30108", "revid": "235382", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=30108", "title": "Ross (New Zealand)", "text": "Ross is a town on the West Coast of the South Island of New Zealand.\nGet in.\nDrive north from Fox Glacier for approximately 1.5\u00a0hr on State Highway 6.\nDo.\nPan for gold at the place just off the main road. You can also buy a pan and try your luck in a nearby stream."}
